#: ../../../reference/extensions/python_api/model/graph.rst:4
msgid "Dependency graph class"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/extensions/python_api/model/graph.rst:6
msgid ""
"A dependency graph is an opaque object, only meant to be produced and "
"consumed by the :class:`GraphAPI <conan.api.subapi.graph.GraphAPI>` methods. "
"It should not be created, inspected, or modified directly."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/extensions/python_api/model/graph.rst:10
msgid ""
"Unless explicitly shown otherwise in the documentation of a specific API "
"method (for example, how to obtain the ``conanfile`` to pass "
"to :meth:`LocalAPI.build() <conan.api.subapi.local.LocalAPI.build>`), the "
"only supported operation on it is calling its ``serialize()`` method, which "
"returns a ``dict`` representation of the graph. That representation follows "
"the same JSON schema documented for the :ref:`\"conan graph info\" JSON "
"formatter <reference_commands_graph_info_json_format>`."
msgstr ""
